{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2024-11", "window": 3, "start_date": 1731715200, "end_date": 1732319999, "month_true_total": 106, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:24:15 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "179589757", "author": {"steamid": "76561197995025164", "personaname": "Sonny Crooked", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197995025164/", "num_games_owned": 153, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 5775, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5013, "last_played": 1733663851, "avatar": "5e80b62fda5530b5412da9fa206bfec26a5ef8b0"}, "language": "english", "review": "I wasn't expecting much from the game as the last - Alien Colonial Marines - was just awful.\nIf you're an Alien fan, you'll get your money's worth here. Everything looks and sounds like in the Alien movies. \nGraphically it's fine, it runs smoothly without any further problems without a NASA computer.\nThe gameplay is quite solid. The selection of weapons is good and can/should also be leveled, as well as the different classes.\nHere is my recommendation, play it with friends. Of course it is also possible with randoms or even with the AI. \nBut no recommendation for a higher difficulty. \nDoes it have replay value?  Shoot, burn, blow up hordes of aliens...absolutely. \nUnfortunately, the game is no longer really on many people's radars and so sometimes it may take a while to find people for co-op.\n", "timestamp_created": 1732301641, "timestamp_updated": 1732301641, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.5", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179511971", "author": {"steamid": "76561199153383707", "personaname":